Z||000005||cifc||08-20-2001||06:40 PM||||Ron Byrd runs the Central Indiana Fiero Club out of Brownsburg, IN.  You should get in touch with him.  The club hasn't been very active in the past couple years, but there is already a membership base.  Probably between 20-30 people.  I was the president in the past, and the problem was that no one wanted to help out, or really even show up.  It gets frustrating after a while.  Anyway, with some organization, and maybe regular planned activities it might go better.  IN the past it has always been a really informal type of thing.<BR>--Jason<p>[This message has been edited by cifc (edited 08-20-2001).]||||reg||1
